		description: "`IconDefaultsProvider` is the mechanism underneath every one of those components: it supplies the class and the token an unstyled `Icon` in its subtree adopts, and `useIconDefaults()` reads the nearest one — `null` outside a provider. The top row is the bare fallback, 20pt on `foreground`; the bottom row inherits 32pt on `primary`.",
